{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[107401,191590201],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_MAIN_COOP_ENTER_SAVE_POINT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[107401,191600201],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_MAIN_COOP_ENTER_SAVE_POINT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_POINT","LNHLPKELCAL":["C1915902_N10000005"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":1073,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_LOCATION"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12910,"speakerName":"Azzam","textMapHash":3897766962,"text":"(There's nothing to worry about... right?)"},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4035878082,"text":"Do you know about \"The Great Machine\"?"},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3622462978,"text":"Could you talk about quadruple-orbit shift?"},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1039907890,"text":"Can you briefly describe the application of the law of triple-orbit shift calculation?"},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":512,"speakerName":"Layla","textMapHash":2499935746,"text":"Okay, I should get started on those notes. If there's anything you're curious about, you may go ahead and ask now. I can answer you as I write! I'm used to multi-tasking."},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":512,"speakerName":"Layla","textMapHash":1782882530,"text":"Oh, and I have to ask a favor. When you give the notes to her later, please don't tell her about my existence."},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1092641594,"text":"Why's that?"},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":512,"speakerName":"Layla","textMapHash":2165278714,"text":"Hmm, well, she's always been in a fragile state. If she knew that there was another \"Layla\" who's always taking care of everything..."},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":512,"speakerName":"Layla","textMapHash":1245793930,"text":"She might feel like everything she's ever worked for is pointless, and that could lead to some demoralizing thoughts."},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":512,"speakerName":"Layla","textMapHash":3701504634,"text":"She's a resilient girl, but no matter how resilient she may be, no one can hold up to criticism and torment from themselves."},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":512,"speakerName":"Layla","textMapHash":1062373978,"text":"If her condition grows any worse, it's possible that I might cease to exist as well. Then there wouldn't be anyone to help her."},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2038089274,"text":"But she's not doing very well now, either."},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":512,"speakerName":"Layla","textMapHash":1423695274,"text":"She's getting better, though, isn't she? It's apparent how hard she's working now."},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":512,"speakerName":"Layla","textMapHash":3837823330,"text":"She's my source of knowledge. I'm merely the representation of how she would be if she were rested and healthy."},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":512,"speakerName":"Layla","textMapHash":3522870458,"text":"I believe that she's one of the best, even in a place like the Akademiya, where geniuses come by the handful."},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":512,"speakerName":"Layla","textMapHash":1272628778,"text":"But growth is a process and shouldn't be rushed. I will always believe in and support her."},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4255229618,"text":"It's good that she has you, or she might've already hit rock bottom."},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":512,"speakerName":"Layla","textMapHash":2633268698,"text":"Hahaha, believe me, even if she were to end up at rock bottom, she'd find a way to somehow laugh it off as one of her silly mistakes and climb her way out."},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":512,"speakerName":"Layla","textMapHash":988014202,"text":"That's the kind of person she is."},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":512,"speakerName":"Layla","textMapHash":1684687482,"text":"Alright, I've written down all the possible questions that I think the advisers might ask. Next, I'll put together a few words of encouragement for her."},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":512,"speakerName":"Layla","textMapHash":2518415162,"text":"I'm not going to sign it, obviously. Oh, and don't forget about our agreement."}],"talkIds":[1915908],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":512,"speakerName":"Layla","count":14},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","count":6},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12910,"speakerName":"Azzam","count":2}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","BEGCMMJKCFC":[],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":4182453406,"CHECNJEMEFE":{"12910":[1120]},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_NONE","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":false,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":3015,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingField":0,"ABDCADBLCFC":0,"AIMIPKGBAHC":"QuestDialogue/COOP/CoopLayla/Q1915908","ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","AOLKCANJCMJ":5,"BKDENCDKDEE":"","BPIIFMJLJAJ":[],"DAMGEPEMGNO":false,"DBACCKDPONG":[],"DIAFFIANKPH":false,"DKOMBMCJMMN":false,"EFBOKHEHKJM":[],"EIDINNIHMHD":false,"EKANPNMEFMG":[],"ENDBMMDPPAH":[],"FALLCBHGKON":"LOGIC_OR","GEPGLHFDBNF":[],"GLJMLHNKKKO":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","HJFLPAICAEO":false,"HNFEAICLPLM":[